{
  "name": "modern-vs-classic",
  "source": "authored",
  "note": "Calibration case for how much recency is allowed to matter. Newer art and pacing are easier to read cold, so among books that represent the pair equally well the modern one should lead. But recency is not quality: a landmark run must stay in view, and a recent book the pair merely pass through must not rank at all.",
